.H1 Pocket Printer Manual
Version 8.x

.H2 Command Line Options
.defn "-h, --help" Show a terse help
.defn "-i, --input <file>" The configuration input file
.defn "-o, --ouput <file>" Filename of the output pdf file
.defn --manual Create a user manual
.defn "--daily DATE" A weekly page-a-day booklet starting on Monday; can specify the date in YYYY-MMM-DD format
.defn "--weekly DATE" A weekly booklet with some preconfigured additional pages; can specify the date
.defn "--file FILENAME" A booklet with text pages all generated from the passed file

.H2 List of Pages
.defn cover A simple cover sheet
.defn lines Plain old lines
.defn dice List of random dice rolls
.defn list A list with checkboxes
.defn grid Simple grid sheet
.defn daily One day calendar page with control over hours and date
.defn weekly Two page spread of the week starting Monday
.defn workweek Single page to plan out the work week (Mon-Fri)
.defn text Prints a text file without modification
.defn score A labeled score sheet 
.defn tracker Habit tracker for the week
.defn trackweek Habit tracker for the month
.defn recipe A text page that includes a special processor for recipes
.defn runoff Text page that processes custom commands that look line nroff/troff
.defn markdown A simplistic markdown converter (reduced command set)
.vs
.H2 Future
.list bulletType="bullet"
.li panel - Repeating panels (meal planner)
.li image
.lend


.H2 Booket options
.defn panels=8 How many panels in the book (8, 4, 2)
.defn showframe=1 Show the panel frame or not (bool, default False)
.defn data_dir=data Directory where the files are for the files command (default current directory)
.defn addpages=True If a text page or similar exceeds a panel, should we add more pages or not (bool, default True)

.H2 Cover Options

A simple cover page with limited formatting commands.

.H2 Commands
.ft body space.after=0 
.b Box
This is the first box

.b box2
This is the second box

\.box2text=<text>
Trying something different

\\# comment line

.style H2  font.color=orange
.H2 Notes

.ft
This is a simple cover page but doesn't do it all


.style h1 font.color=blue
.h1 Dictionary

.ft space.after=0 font.color=green
.b word_in_bold
The definition of the word

.b word2_in_bold
Second definition

.b word3_in_bold
Third definition

.h2 Next section Heading

.H1 Types of Pages
# List format I usees list->li -> lend
# .style bullet font.color=blue
.list bulletType="bullet"
.li <b><i>cover</i></b> Page cover page cover page for the booklet and this is a long list item that has a bunch of words
.li <b><i>daily</i></b> Single day calendar page with control over hours and date
.li grid
.li lines
.li list
.li recipe
.li runoff
.li text
.li weekly
.lend
